    "result_text": "All tests pass. The implementation is complete.\n\n## Summary\n\nThe spec required the owner resource to return `selfLink` = `/api/owners/` followed by the new owner's id. I made two changes:\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 Added a read-only `selfLink` string property to the `Owner` schema (the DTOs are generated from this spec at build time), so `OwnerDto` now carries a `selfLink` field.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 Added a `@Mapping(target = \"selfLink\", ...)` on `toOwnerDto(...)` plus a `formatSelfLink(Owner)` helper that returns `\"/api/owners/\" + owner.getId()` (and `null` when the owner/id is absent), following the same pattern as the other derived fields in this mapper.\n\nVerification:\n- Target test `AcceptanceTest.coreReturnsSelfLink` passes (asserts `$.selfLink` == `/api/owners/{id}` on `GET /api/owners/{id}`).\n- Full suite: `Tests run: 1, Failures: 0, Errors: 0` \u2014 **BUILD SUCCESS**.",
